Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,OP
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.48,0:02:45.62,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,強力凜然振翅高飛
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.86,0:03:00.70,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,像這樣與你相遇
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.00,0:03:05.91,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,並不是只為了生存下去
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.12,0:03:12.72,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,小小的誓言超越時空
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.08,0:03:17.75,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,必定會改變未來的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.30,0:03:21.17,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,LIMITER　（changing myself）
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.17,0:03:24.37,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,釋放出來　（changing youself）
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.45,0:03:30.23,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,迸發吧　天使的光芒
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.63,0:03:34.20,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,拯救世界 「翼」
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.20,0:03:37.07,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,我現在選擇的道路
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.27,0:03:43.48,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,想要抓住夢幻（停不下來）
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.59,0:03:46.38,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,被賦予的力量
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.38,0:03:49.02,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,向著天空迫近
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.02,0:03:54.79,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,強力凜然振翅高飛
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.09,0:04:00.66,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,絕對可憐　my wings
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,ED
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.32,0:22:26.03,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,緊緊地抱住逞強的你
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.03,0:22:28.99,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,就連難過的側臉　全部
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.99,0:22:31.35,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,讓·人·心·愛
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.35,0:22:35.56,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,每打破障壁都會變強的女人啊
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.56,0:22:41.47,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,我的眼·睛　沒有不正常
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.73,0:22:46.73,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,過於率直的心中的情感
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.73,0:22:50.27,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,是不會輸給任何人的
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.27,0:22:55.54,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,絕對不會放開你　不管在什麼時候
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.54,0:23:00.75,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,這看不到結局的一切　由我來改變
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.75,0:23:05.08,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,惡魔和天使都有翅膀
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.08,0:23:10.73,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,指引著前往更高的天空
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.73,0:23:15.44,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,不會再讓你的笑容變得陰沉
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.44,0:23:21.81,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,連結的希望　現在撕裂了黑暗
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.81,0:23:24.77,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,和你一起
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.98,0:23:30.72,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,500)}向著明天飛躍　Break Your Destiny
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.52,0:00:09.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可惡  失策了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.56,0:00:19.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她沒問題嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.98,0:00:23.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,別看她那個樣子  她可是在訓練學校以第一名的成績畢業的
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.38,0:00:25.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一定沒問題的
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.23,0:00:27.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,請開始進行作戰
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.16,0:00:28.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,了解
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.89,0:00:32.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,唔…解禁需要
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.00,0:00:34.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,上上下右左左下右
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.97,0:00:36.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再更裡面  左…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.35,0:00:39.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的沒問題嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.41,0:00:42.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,別看她那個樣子  她可是在訓練學校…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.67,0:00:45.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,特…特特…特殊超能力者The Hou…Hou…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.88,0:00:49.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊啊  要更有氣勢點
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.32,0:00:52.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,特殊超能力者The Hound  解…解禁
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.43,0:00:58.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什麼嘛  這點程度小意思啦
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.33,0:01:01.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我會將你們救出去的
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.22,0:01:05.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是現在已經是我的極限了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.77,0:01:06.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,發現目標
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.78,0:01:10.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,偷出來的大量限定版小莫佳也在一起
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.60,0:01:13.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,請開始進行作戰
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.37,0:01:13.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,了解
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.86,0:01:15.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要再在這裡做傻事了…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.50,0:01:18.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,老鼠…是宿木明嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.88,0:01:21.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,目標開始移動了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.46,0:01:23.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,初音  他朝你那邊去了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.90,0:01:25.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,初音？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.05,0:01:28.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不用你說  我也知道他的氣味在接近
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.76,0:01:29.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,初音知道的很
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.62,0:01:32.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs28}Metamorphosis{\r}\N變身
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.82,0:01:38.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好痛  放開我  放開我
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.19,0:01:41.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,狼？！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.96,0:01:46.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,犬神初音嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.46,0:01:52.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,飯
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.03,0:01:54.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,初…初音
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.13,0:02:02.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,初音
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.14,0:02:03.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,初音
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.08,0:02:06.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好痛
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.73,0:02:11.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,飯！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.20,0:02:14.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,項鍊…不見了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.87,0:02:15.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你在幹什麼啊  初音
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.10,0:02:16.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快點追上去
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.18,0:02:17.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,初音
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.80,0:02:20.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,項鍊我會去找的…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.15,0:02:24.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,找到了  初音  找到了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.65,0:02:25.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.89,0:02:28.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要碰它
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.92,0:04:10.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我回來…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.55,0:04:13.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒見過的鞋子啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.53,0:04:15.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這種時間有客人來？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.46,0:04:17.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊  歡迎回來
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.69,0:04:18.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你在做什麼啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.83,0:04:19.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒…沒什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.16,0:04:21.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是…是啊  沒做什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.87,0:04:23.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,跳電了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.38,0:04:24.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哪個
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.27,0:04:26.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不能進來
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.06,0:04:28.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不  那個…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.15,0:04:31.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,薰嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.29,0:04:35.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你聲音怎麼了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.62,0:04:37.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,咳咳  感冒了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.05,0:04:40.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這是什麼  耳朵？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.33,0:04:41.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,跟貓耳一樣
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.73,0:04:44.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喵  我戴著貓耳在玩喵
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.26,0:04:46.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小…小薰很喜歡玩的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.11,0:04:48.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,欸  鼻子？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.22,0:04:50.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,相當長嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.93,0:04:52.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,呃…呃…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.94,0:04:54.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是個不擅長即興發揮的人啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.87,0:04:56.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這時應該說有天狗在嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.80,0:04:58.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哦  什麼啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.56,0:05:00.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這個野獸一般的嘴巴和獠牙
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.77,0:05:03.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,無法圓謊了！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.72,0:05:07.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這是為了吃你啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.50,0:05:11.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,初音  住手
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.16,0:05:13.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不行
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.77,0:05:15.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,初…初音君？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.53,0:05:17.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這樣啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.63,0:05:19.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她以為我是要帶她回去啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.21,0:05:21.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好像是這樣
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.75,0:05:22.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這就是說
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.98,0:05:23.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,初音…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.30,0:05:25.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,離家出走了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.97,0:05:26.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這樣啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.99,0:05:29.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什麼…離家出走？！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.67,0:05:31.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs32\pos(730,570)\fad(500,500)}35th  sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.67,0:05:31.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs32\pos(780,600)\fad(500,500)}「多情多恨！初音離家出走」
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.31,0:05:35.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,初音不想在Hound裡做了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.59,0:05:36.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你說不做了是…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.91,0:05:38.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,從今天起加入Children
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.85,0:05:39.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,欸
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.11,0:05:42.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,絕對不再回去了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.08,0:05:44.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可以養吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.35,0:05:46.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她的教養也非常好
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.41,0:05:48.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我們會照顧她的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.40,0:05:49.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大姐頭  汪
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.53,0:05:51.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她是人啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.25,0:05:53.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,初音大人離家出走了？！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.97,0:05:57.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這是怎麼回事啊  他犯了什麼過錯嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.47,0:05:59.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,明  馬上去把她帶回來
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.79,0:06:01.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,唔…這是誰
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.30,0:06:04.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這位是我住在東北的老爸
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.88,0:06:07.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這樣啊  你的老家是…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.60,0:06:11.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以父親也能夠和動物交換意識
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.85,0:06:14.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而且還能操作聲帶進行對話
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.15,0:06:20.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,老爸  我不是一直跟你說有什麼話要說就用電話嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.62,0:06:24.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你太卑鄙了  居然利用老鷹眼睛被遮住就會變得安分的習性
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.33,0:06:27.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,過來  過來
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.15,0:06:27.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,汪汪
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.49,0:06:30.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要  初音絕不回去
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.32,0:06:32.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,初音你是好孩子
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.08,0:06:33.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.89,0:06:34.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,初音
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.34,0:06:36.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,初音離家出走了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.87,0:06:38.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你在說什麼任性的話啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.07,0:06:40.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,初音一點都不任性
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.17,0:06:42.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我討厭那女人
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.88,0:06:48.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她和新任的擔當指揮官就那麼合不來嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.89,0:06:50.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,原因是？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.12,0:06:53.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我們也完全摸不著頭緒啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.02,0:06:56.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要求Children出動
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.81,0:07:03.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的能賺到零用錢嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.23,0:07:04.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你就看起來好了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.95,0:07:09.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你以為我是為了什麼才大量入手限定版的小萌香啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.17,0:07:12.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,完全是因為你的個人興趣吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.67,0:07:14.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,才不是個人興趣
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.20,0:07:15.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,欸
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.57,0:07:17.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是生存方式！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.98,0:07:19.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,方式  哐哐
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.85,0:07:24.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在這裡的大量限定版小萌香現在已經缺貨了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.49,0:07:26.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在網拍上是以高價交易的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.29,0:07:30.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,高價交易和賺零用錢有什麼關係呢
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.12,0:07:34.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你還是那麼笨啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.26,0:07:35.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,誰…誰是笨蛋啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.87,0:07:40.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我可不想被你也用手指指著…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.89,0:07:42.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,欸  你？！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.86,0:07:44.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你們
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.12,0:07:45.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼知道這裡的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.91,0:07:49.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是因為你把大量偷盜的物品光明正大地放到網拍上拍賣了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.64,0:07:51.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你認為這樣還不足以確定場所嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.07,0:07:52.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,切
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.93,0:07:55.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,說起來  網拍到底是什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.96,0:07:58.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這東西就連鼯鼠都知道啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.33,0:08:01.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,The Children  解禁
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.60,0:08:05.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一掌定乾坤  紅色之星
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.54,0:08:07.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,轉瞬即逝  蒼蘭之風
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.72,0:08:09.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,飄然一朵  紫色之花
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.12,0:08:12.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,狼吞虎嚥  好吃的飯
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.70,0:08:13.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,開場白好長
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.94,0:08:16.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,今天多了一個人  所以特別長
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.29,0:08:17.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不好意思  還差一點
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.70,0:08:18.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,俐落點
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.01,0:08:21.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,絕對可憐The Children
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.47,0:08:22.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,外加
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.49,0:08:22.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,汪
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.91,0:08:26.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,為什麼不趁這段時間逃跑呢
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.77,0:08:28.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因為這種是固定套路嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.71,0:08:29.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這樣啊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.71,0:08:30.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那麼接下來就拜託你了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.00,0:08:31.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快跑快跑
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.56,0:08:32.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂  你給我站住
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.62,0:08:33.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,初音  不要讓他跑掉
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.83,0:08:34.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,交給我吧  大姐頭
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.33,0:08:36.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs28}Metamorphosis{\r}\N變身
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.38,0:08:41.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊  糟了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.81,0:08:42.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這簡直是如繪畫一般的…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.53,0:08:47.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,初音
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.74,0:08:53.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你來做什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.39,0:08:55.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是Hound的擔當指揮官
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.98,0:08:59.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,既然你出動了  我不能坐視不管
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.47,0:09:01.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,初音不在Hound做了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.34,0:09:03.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,欸  怎麼這樣…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.96,0:09:05.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你真廢
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.97,0:09:08.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,說的更傲矯一些啊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.28,0:09:11.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我…我可不是來救你的哦
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.32,0:09:12.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是這個
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.33,0:09:14.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂  你抓哪裡啊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.66,0:09:16.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,逃掉了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.78,0:09:18.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,都怪你
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.10,0:09:20.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎…怎麼這樣
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.50,0:09:22.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要咬碎你
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.74,0:09:23.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,初音  不行
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.35,0:09:27.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大…大姐頭
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.73,0:09:29.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是Hound的指揮官？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.44,0:09:32.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的  我是小鹿圭子一曹
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.25,0:09:35.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要咬你  絕對要咬你
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.79,0:09:37.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,為什麼這麼討厭我啊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.30,0:09:41.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,人類光靠交談是無法互相理解的嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.49,0:09:43.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我討厭你的一切  不要靠近我
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.73,0:09:45.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要停止你的一切
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.18,0:09:48.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哇  全盤否定
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.03,0:09:52.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,連我的存在本身都要全盤否定嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.28,0:09:53.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,初音
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.47,0:09:57.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你這笨蛋  盡給大家添麻煩
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.51,0:09:58.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,道歉
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.39,0:09:59.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要  絕對不道歉
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.19,0:10:01.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你有什麼不滿啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.72,0:10:02.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,全部
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.65,0:10:04.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這樣我們怎麼知道啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.53,0:10:06.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,對不起  小鹿主任
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.24,0:10:07.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒關係
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.18,0:10:10.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一定是我不好
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.23,0:10:11.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,才沒有這回事
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.50,0:10:12.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你沒有錯
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.78,0:10:13.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你很努力了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.16,0:10:18.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你很出色  請不要拋下我們
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.83,0:10:30.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你居然帶著這種東西四處走動嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.24,0:10:33.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,吹箭不違法  而且似乎對減肥也很有效
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.18,0:10:34.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒事吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.63,0:10:38.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好…好可怕
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.20,0:10:39.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂  明
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.96,0:10:43.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不管怎麼看  原因都只有這個了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.37,0:10:43.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.16,0:10:45.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,初音好可憐
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.76,0:10:51.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哪個  告訴我
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.25,0:10:52.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好遲鈍
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.19,0:10:55.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是因為這樣  所以說男人啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.17,0:10:59.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不  我想我應該是沒到這程度吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.28,0:11:00.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,完全沒有自覺啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.28,0:11:05.51,zhushi,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an9\fad(500,500)}小鹿  圭子  一曹\N簡歷\NB.A.B.E.L訓練學校中以第一名成績畢業\N（主席應該是首席的筆誤）\N入局後即選拔為特務超能力小隊\NTHE HOUND的指揮官\N自小喜歡動物 深受動畫DVD等的影響
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.86,0:11:07.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs28}庭にコンドルがめりこんどる{\r}\N禿鷹嵌在庭院裡了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.26,0:11:12.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs28}ルールルル　キツネじゃない{\r}\NRuRuRuRu  不是狐狸
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.67,0:11:16.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,原來是吃醋啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.83,0:11:17.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,對不起了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.32,0:11:20.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不  是我不對
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.18,0:11:24.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因為我剛進入B.A.B.E.L  做事還不可靠
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.75,0:11:26.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,多虧明君幫我善後了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.21,0:11:31.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不  我也因為想要小鹿主任快點習慣
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.59,0:11:33.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以將初音的事情給往後推了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.81,0:11:36.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,至少應該安排男性的指揮官嗎…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.89,0:11:37.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不  話不是這麼說…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.34,0:11:41.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是我想在這工作上好好努力的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.45,0:11:43.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我自小就很喜歡動物
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.60,0:11:48.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,動畫「浣熊塔斯卡爾」和「佛林得斯的狗」DVD我都有全套的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.39,0:11:50.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,單純是喜歡這類的動畫吧…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.19,0:11:53.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,對於人來說吃醋也是很麻煩的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.11,0:11:56.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而初音是無限接近於動物的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.38,0:12:00.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看到身為飼主的明圍著新人團團轉那自然會自暴自棄的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.16,0:12:03.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,總之  已經知道原因了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.35,0:12:04.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就盡可能地善後吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.15,0:12:05.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,善後？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.95,0:12:09.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,問題在於小鹿小姐沒有徹底成為Hound的領隊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.16,0:12:12.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,必須要展示出強力的領袖氣質和威信
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.15,0:12:15.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,領袖氣質和威信
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.65,0:12:16.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,像這樣嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.14,0:12:18.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,又扯出會引起著作權問題的…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.76,0:12:19.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那就上吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.90,0:12:23.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,B.A.B.E.L 2 發射
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.78,0:12:26.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哇  好快
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.95,0:12:36.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,取名為「極限狀態！透過野外生存來提升信賴度作戰」
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.34,0:12:44.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一上來就搞這手嗎…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.32,0:12:46.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有什麼意見嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.22,0:12:47.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.94,0:12:49.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,肉
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.57,0:12:52.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,明
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.58,0:12:53.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼了  明
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.54,0:12:58.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你醒過來了啊  初音
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.43,0:13:02.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,聽我說  初音
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.26,0:13:06.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,明君現在處於危險的狀態
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.41,0:13:07.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,危險？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.46,0:13:08.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.51,0:13:11.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,必須在兩小時以內將他搬到救難艇上才行
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.11,0:13:14.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,救難艇距離這裡一百公里
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.09,0:13:15.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一百公里？！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.66,0:13:19.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是如果不這麼做  明君的性命就…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.69,0:13:27.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的沒問題嗎  這樣子
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.29,0:13:30.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,明  你竟然憑依到了這麼可愛的生物身上
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.29,0:13:30.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs28\pos(544,660)}Replace
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.92,0:13:32.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我已經忍不住了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.02,0:13:34.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一起拍照吧  拜託了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.85,0:13:36.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,連…連朧小姐也…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.51,0:13:39.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不不  我的內心還是少女  有什麼問題嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.21,0:13:39.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,明君
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.56,0:13:43.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,初音君將薰作為老大認可了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.02,0:13:49.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,確實  初音應該會順從她認為比自己高位的人
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.96,0:13:53.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這裡是小紅帽
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.16,0:13:56.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,順利引導大灰狼
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.07,0:13:58.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,柏木小姐  你有在聽嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.01,0:14:00.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這…這裡是獵人
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.72,0:14:02.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我們在十五公里後方跟蹤追趕
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.09,0:14:04.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,請繼續進行作戰
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.63,0:14:05.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,了解
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.85,0:14:08.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,初音  加油
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.16,0:14:11.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,初音…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.93,0:14:24.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,暴風雪停了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.97,0:14:28.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊  定時聯絡的時間
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.42,0:14:31.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂喂  這裡是小紅帽
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.13,0:14:33.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,和大灰狼順利移動中
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.62,0:14:36.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,差不多要到初音吃飯的時間了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.90,0:14:38.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,明君是這樣說的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.76,0:14:40.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,朧小姐？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.23,0:14:42.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這裡是老奶奶…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.39,0:14:43.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.50,0:14:46.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,通訊…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.46,0:14:48.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,艦船的通訊也全部停止了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.92,0:14:50.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,電子裝置全部當機了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.65,0:14:52.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,故障嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.74,0:14:53.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,掛掉了…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.51,0:14:57.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,休息一下  來吃飯吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.31,0:14:58.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,吃飯！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.28,0:15:01.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊  初音她…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.27,0:15:06.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,對我那般露出獠牙的初音  她竟然露出這樣的表情…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.93,0:15:12.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,B.A.B.E.L的緊急食物的話我有很多
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.39,0:15:13.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你就選自己喜歡的吃吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.88,0:15:17.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,咦…咦？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.51,0:15:20.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,吃飯  吃飯
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.75,0:15:23.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,吃飯  吃飯
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.16,0:15:26.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,吶  初音
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.75,0:15:28.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那個啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.47,0:15:34.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,居然說忘記帶開罐器了？！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.32,0:15:35.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,對不起  對不起
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.22,0:15:38.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,給我打開  給我打開
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.42,0:15:39.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,裡面凍起來了  完全無能為力
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.35,0:15:43.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼辦  尋找便利商店？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.90,0:15:44.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒有的吧…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.30,0:15:45.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,明…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.44,0:15:49.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,為了救明  需要力量
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.82,0:15:52.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,肉  不吃肉的話！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.71,0:16:01.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什…什麼  這眼神
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.33,0:16:03.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可怕…感覺好可怕
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.89,0:16:06.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,肉
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.25,0:16:10.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這不是因為故障
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.36,0:16:14.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是因為大規模的太陽耀斑的影響而產生的磁氣風暴
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.54,0:16:18.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,無線電打不通  我是不是回到身體裡去比較好啊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.35,0:16:20.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,明君這樣說到
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.45,0:16:22.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不行
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.13,0:16:26.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,現在你處於超低溫的假死狀態
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.17,0:16:30.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她們有好好相處嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.76,0:16:32.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,明君這樣說道
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.01,0:16:35.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒問題的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.20,0:16:40.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,初音只是因為來了不認識的人而感到害怕而已
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.67,0:16:43.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你很努力啊  很痛吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.86,0:16:47.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,當然不算什麼了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.49,0:16:48.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我很強的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.07,0:16:51.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我理解這份心情
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.00,0:16:53.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因為想要信任所以才會害怕
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.22,0:16:58.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Hound也一定能夠成為好隊伍的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.59,0:17:10.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,肉Get！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.44,0:17:13.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,慢著…  不是吧！住手！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.91,0:17:16.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不可能說允許這麼殘忍的事情吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.51,0:17:24.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,家長？！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.47,0:17:25.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,家長來了！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.54,0:17:35.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,初音
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.66,0:17:38.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,初音珍視的…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.55,0:17:41.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要碰它
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.99,0:17:49.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,初…初音！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.22,0:17:59.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好冷
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.06,0:18:03.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,意識…  明…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.89,0:18:08.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因為初音很笨
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.12,0:18:12.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,自小就一直給他添麻煩
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.59,0:18:17.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,明是初音的哥哥
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.33,0:18:20.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,媽媽
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.50,0:18:25.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是…正因為如此…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.08,0:18:28.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,無論何時何地
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.59,0:18:32.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,初音都會為了明而戰
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.75,0:18:41.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,為了明…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.89,0:18:42.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,為了明…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.86,0:18:44.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,吃
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.87,0:18:58.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,已經…不行了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.11,0:19:02.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,明…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.95,0:19:14.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,對不起了  回到海裡去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.08,0:19:25.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Come Back  肉
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.45,0:19:27.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,飯  飯…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.65,0:19:29.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,走掉了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.28,0:19:33.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你居然敢自作主張！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.79,0:19:35.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不吃飯的話  明…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.24,0:19:38.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可是再這樣下去的話  你就…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.39,0:19:40.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果救不了明  那初音還不如死掉算了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.84,0:19:46.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你在說什麼蠢話啊
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.73,0:19:50.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,必須要三個人一起走到救難艇去
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.07,0:20:06.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那個…差不多該…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.01,0:20:08.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不好
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.93,0:20:11.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因為濡濕了  全身開始急劇發冷了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.69,0:20:13.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在凍僵之前必須要想辦法…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.88,0:20:14.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,便利商店  便利商店
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.17,0:20:16.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒有啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.65,0:20:28.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小鹿小姐
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.41,0:20:29.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒事吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.99,0:20:42.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.27,0:20:46.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不是說了  會成為好隊伍的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.59,0:20:51.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好漂亮
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.04,0:20:53.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好厲害  極光啊
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.84,0:20:57.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太陽耀斑不只是會引起磁氣風暴
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.79,0:21:01.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,還能夠看到極光的
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.95,0:21:07.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太美妙了  柏木君要是也來就好了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.01,0:21:12.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,終於  終於…我的  我的…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.65,0:21:13.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看啊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.61,0:21:14.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好讚  太讚了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.06,0:21:17.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,極光是高能量大氣中的…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.57,0:21:19.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只要漂亮就行了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.50,0:21:22.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,還發生了這樣的事情啊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.75,0:21:24.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以才那麼…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.46,0:21:24.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,給
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.33,0:21:29.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好像沒有我的容身之處了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.08,0:21:31.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,初音被搶走了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.30,0:21:31.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,驚！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.00,0:21:35.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,之前還是那麼黏明的
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.37,0:21:36.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我能理解你的心情
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.78,0:21:39.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是個男人  就痛痛快快地抽身而退吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.20,0:21:42.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不  我不明白你的意思
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.33,0:21:43.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,青春啊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.02,0:21:45.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,奈津子也曾有過嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.72,0:21:46.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你這是什麼意思
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.08,0:21:48.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不  沒什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.55,0:21:51.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,緊急指令  要求The Hound出動
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.42,0:21:56.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,九具津隆想要再度賣掉限定版小莫佳
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.20,0:21:58.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,請下指令
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.92,0:21:59.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,走吧  小鹿
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.11,0:22:05.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,特殊超能力者The Hound  解禁
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.72,0:23:42.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,下回的絕對可憐Children是
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.69,0:23:44.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看來今天會很順利
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.58,0:23:45.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我有這樣的預感
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.94,0:23:47.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什麼事情會很順利啊
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.52,0:23:50.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,老師  我可以躺下嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.52,0:23:51.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,躺下？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.53,0:23:53.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再放鬆些
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.68,0:23:54.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒錯
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.93,0:23:56.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我已經按耐不住了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.61,0:23:58.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,絕對可憐Children
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.23,0:24:01.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,第36話  「男子不得進入！天使們的午後」
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.88,0:24:04.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,直美  我的直美她…！
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.83,0:24:05.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是是
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.20,0:24:08.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,絕對可憐  所以不會輸！

